        METHOD BROYDEN_MIXING
        ALPHA 0.2
        BETA 0.5
        NBUFFER 8
      &END MIXING
      &SMEAR ON
        METHOD FERMI_DIRAC
        ELECTRONIC_TEMPERATURE [K] 300
      &END SMEAR
    &END SCF
    &XC
      &XC_FUNCTIONAL PBE
      &END XC_FUNCTIONAL
    &END XC
  &END DFT
